=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a YAML tag in the pytest hook puts the pre-commit config out of the reader's reach
origin: issue #196 ruling 191.3 — the hook inventory reads the base side, whose pytest hook
origin2: runs, and declines the head side, where the hook's stages hide behind a tag.
origin3: v0.5.0 read neither side's change and passed this diff at warn.
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
        stages: !!seq [manual]
